## Source

- **barely** is built from this repository at tag `v@VERSION@`.
- **The guest kernel** is Linux @KERNEL@ with the patches in [`kernel/patches`](https://github.com/barelyvm/barely/tree/v@VERSION@/kernel/patches) and the configuration in [`kernel/config-arm64`](https://github.com/barelyvm/barely/blob/v@VERSION@/kernel/config-arm64). [`kernel/build.sh`](https://github.com/barelyvm/barely/blob/v@VERSION@/kernel/build.sh) builds it. The kernel is licensed under GPL-2.0.
- **The guest root image** is Alpine Linux with the packages listed in [`guest/build.sh`](https://github.com/barelyvm/barely/blob/v@VERSION@/guest/build.sh), unmodified.
- **libkrun** and **gvisor-tap-vsock** are built from the forks at the commits pinned in [`libkrun.env`](https://github.com/barelyvm/barely/blob/v@VERSION@/libkrun.env) and [`go.mod`](https://github.com/barelyvm/barely/blob/v@VERSION@/go.mod).
